Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.49,0:00:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Lisa, hand me my gauge, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.91,0:00:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,--Here.\N--Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you making something new for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.79,0:00:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no telling when the Evangelist's\Npeople will show up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There. Lisa, that's all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. If you need anything else, just call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's put up with a ton \Nof abuse from Haijima.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And after how Dr. Giovani hurt Lisa,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make damn sure\NHaijima pays for what they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's kick their asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinra, before you enrolled\Nat the training academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you were at a Haijima facility, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You could be a spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, maybe so. I could be a spy,\Nif it meant being able to assassinate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}are{\i0} a spy! Come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.75,0:01:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} coming at {\i1}me{\i0}, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.09,0:01:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think you could beat\Nthe Knight King's sword skills?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who hit me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,--You devil! Devil! Devil!\N--You stupid knight! Stupid knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinra, you were once at Haijima?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Oh, yeah. When my abilities\Nsurfaced after the fire 12 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.49,0:01:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a period where\NI couldn't control them very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.66,0:01:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That was when...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.32,0:01:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...I underwent experiments at\Na Haijima pyrokinesis development institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.75,0:01:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still remember how \Nchilling it felt there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.37,0:01:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All the employees saw the children\Nas nothing more than test subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't feel the slightest bit\Nof warmth from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want for anything there,\Nbut it wasn't exactly cozy, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinra-{\i1}kun{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Licht?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.34,0:01:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a somewhat important\Nmatter I need to discuss,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'd like to get everyone together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A-All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.41,0:03:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's this important matter\Nyou need to discuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is extremely hard for me to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and I apologize in advance,\Nbut I, Viktor Licht...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...am a Haijima spy, \Nembedded here at the 8th.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.85,0:04:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Huh? You seem underwhelmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, we knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So why speak up now?\NYou were never actually posted to the 8th.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.70,0:04:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always been with Haijima, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Does that mean that\NLicht-{\i1}san{\i0} isn't one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. As you were, Sister. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that will speed this along.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My primary objective in coming to the 8th
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.34,0:04:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,was to observe Shinra-{\i1}kun \{\i0}Nand his Adolla Burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Haijima has been looking for\Nthe next bearer of an Adolla Burst,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,just like the Evangelist,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.26,0:04:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and for that reason,\NI was sent here to spy on Shinra-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.35,0:04:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But Shinra was already at Haijima, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like they let Shinra's Adolla Burst\Nget away from them pretty easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and that is what\NI would like to speak about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinra-{\i1}kun{\i0}, after your house burned down,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,you were taken in by a Haijima\Npyrokinesis development institute, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.41,0:04:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, from when I was 5 until I was 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,At age 13, I enrolled at\Nthe Fire Force Training Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As it happens, they were researching\NAdolla Bursts at that facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonetheless, the Haijima\Nresearchers there at the time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,could not identify your flame\Nas being an Adolla Burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, lightweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.59,0:05:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?\NYou're the last person to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where the issue arises.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.35,0:05:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they discovered the fact that\Nthey passed over Shinra-{\i1}kun{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.73,0:05:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the facility has gotten a lot more\Nradical with their experiments,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.39,0:05:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,enough so that people are getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So much so that some of\Nthe kids will never recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.74,0:05:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And the thing that triggered all this\Nwas letting Shinra-{\i1}kun{\i0} get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man... Because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.33,0:05:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, they've finally ordered me\Nto bring Shinra-{\i1}kun{\i0} back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.83,0:05:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can\Nsell out one of our crewmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, to be sure. Haijima is\Nclearly out for Shinra-{\i1}kun{\i0}'s Adolla Burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I think of this as being\Na chance to investigate Haijima.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.43,0:06:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,None of Haijima's people \Nknow the nitty-gritty
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,of the pyrokinesis development\Nfacility, including me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.77,0:06:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If we agree to go in,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,we may be able to find a connection\Nbetween the facility and the Evangelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a Haijima spy, aren't you?!\NI'm not about to trust you so quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Vulcan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If what Inspector Licht says is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,then I can't just leave\Nthe children there to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, I'm okay with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of hero am I\Nif I can't keep children safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinra, don't rush into any decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to take three years before\Nthe truth about Amaterasu goes public.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, the Evangelist's plans\Njust keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time for playing it slow and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Sho is still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Licht,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.81,0:06:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the most important question still remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you on, \Nthe 8th's, or Haijima's?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.77,0:06:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.77,0:06:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with Haijima because\NI can research the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:06:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But right now, I'm partial to the 8th.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The 8th seems like it's closer to the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like you're\Nreally part of either one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a sharp observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinra, I can't let you go to Haijima\Nby yourself. It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All 8th personnel will be conducting\Nan investigation of Haijima.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yes, sir!\N--Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Commence "Operation Investigate\NHaijima Industries"!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.55,0:07:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,--Roger!\N--Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nataku-{\i1}kun{\i0}, we're starting a combat test.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.19,0:07:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurono-{\i1}kun{\i0}, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nataku, care to go a round\Nwith your Uncle Reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.17,0:07:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be the third combat test, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be an unexpected surprise\Nfrom that earlier incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't break him, if you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you may begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you have another experiment\Nwith your Uncle Reaper today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uncle Reaper...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...when will I be able to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You recognize this grim reaper symbol, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.31,0:08:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going home until you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:09:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your third test, too. It's about time\NI started fighting like I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nataku, you'll have to knuckle down, too,\Nor you could go home in a coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to show me your true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Click!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! I know you can do it! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you've been chosen by the Insects!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.09,0:09:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them how hot-blooded you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them how passionate you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.23,0:09:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! Fire! Click!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.03,0:09:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.66,0:09:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit, that's the spirit!\NThat's good! That's hot! Keep at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:10:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Breathe in, just like that!\NShout it out from deep inside! Waah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it out, let it out even more!\NI know you can do it! Let yourself roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame output rising.\NStill unable to detect an Adolla Burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His mental state is growing unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,From the trauma of that incident.\NWhat do we do, stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.53,0:10:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinra Kusakabe is said to have\Nsparked his Adolla Burst
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.82,0:10:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,through actual combat and combat training.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We continue. And if he breaks, that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be a shame, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Uncle Reaper's job, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.15,0:11:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to go along with this,\Nor I can't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard enough just to watch.\NI'm surprised he can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that to him,\Nthis is his true calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.54,0:11:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got the skills it would take\Nto fight in an actual combat unit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.25,0:11:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but apparently, he remains here by choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so he can pick on children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,His right arm is already\Ncarbonized from tephrosis,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but he still seeks to destroy even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.47,0:11:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's completely around the bend, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But his abilities are the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.85,0:11:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he rivals even\Nthe captain of the 7th.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurono-{\i1}kun{\i0}, that's good. That was plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work in there, Kurono-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm impressed. You don't\Nfeel weird about beating up kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I love bullying the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The weaker they are, the less I have to\Nworry about myself getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why you're so willing to\Ngo along with what we adults say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.98,0:12:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You are really getting on my nerves now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.56,0:12:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that when I say "weak,"\Nthat includes you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.69,0:12:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I am ridiculously powerful against the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.57,0:12:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that! He didn't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that Shinra Kusakabe\Nwould be coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, he's going to be facing me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.09,0:12:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's weak, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.27,0:13:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinra-{\i1}kun{\i0}, thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Think nothing of it.\NWhen you spoke about the facility,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,it reminded me of someone who was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy who was at the facility\Nbeing treated for tephrosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.99,0:13:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember how depraved he was, even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,--What the...? Hey, what are you doing?!\N--Hey, get away from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,--Behave yourself!\N--Come on, stop squirming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.14,0:13:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,--It's no fair that only you guys are allowed.\N--Behave yourself!\N--Come on, stop squirming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.10,0:13:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,--It's no fair that only you guys are allowed.\N--Are you listening to me?!\N--Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.89,0:13:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,--Let me play with the kids, too.\N--Are you listening to me?!\N--Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.44,0:13:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That was probably Kurono.\NI've heard stories about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.23,0:13:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Shinmon of the 7th is\Nwell-known as being the "Mightiest,"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but this man Kurono is said to be\Nthe "Maddest" pyrokinetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are. Does it bring back any memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.13,0:14:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Was this the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.75,0:14:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they do change the locations\Nof their labs periodically
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.63,0:14:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep their information hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Which just goes to show\Nhow disgraceful what they're doing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.43,0:14:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Viktor Licht, chief researcher,\Napplied pyrokinesiology lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.77,0:14:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, we're expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.32,0:14:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah. Security is\Nkeeping a close eye on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.95,0:14:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As if to say, "You're definitely\Nnot getting out of here."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I have to admit, I'm excited\Nto get to observe such a shady facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you should be saying that\Nin front of the security guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:14:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get killed here anyway, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.43,0:15:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let them kill you.\NI promise, I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.85,0:15:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Licht, even if \Nyou are a Haijima spy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you've still saved me time and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're someone we definitely need at the 8th.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm pleased to hear it.\NI can die happy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what he just \Nsaid about me, Joker?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I may just leave you for the 8th.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.62,0:15:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Joker be the only one\Nout there risking his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.25,0:15:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wrote that ridiculous report\Nto rankle the top brass
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so I could get some dirt on Haijima.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to exploit the good will\Nof the 8th and Shinra-{\i1}kun{\i0} to that end
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,if it means getting my hands on the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been expecting you. Welcome to\Nthe pyrokinesis development lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.89,0:15:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids will be thrilled to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.52,0:15:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell can you say that,\Nwhen you torture kids the way you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course. You want to see\Nthe children right away, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.57,0:15:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, come on inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--How cute!\N--Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hey, I want to try!\N--Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.29,0:16:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how we take care of children
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,who still do not know\Nhow to control their abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I requested that I be allowed\Nto see the boy you took in
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,after the Rekka Hoshimiya incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but was told that I was not authorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.05,0:16:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see how he is. Is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.34,0:16:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you must mean Nataku-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a special case,\Nso he is not at this facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.11,0:16:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,An Adolla Link!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinra-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.83,0:16:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, an Adolla Link.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell he isn't here.\NThis is where that boy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.54,0:16:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They really are hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.63,0:17:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play along with them for a bit\Nand see what we can uncover.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Crewman Kusakabe, thanks for your help\Nwith our Adolla Burst observations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be a simulated battle test,\Nif you'd be so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This cold, empty room...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.12,0:17:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...makes me feel like I'm having\Nchills right down to my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.41,0:17:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When I think of how they're\Ntreating me like a lab rat,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,my humanity just melts away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Until nothing but my weird tic remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to working with you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.89,0:17:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make this a fun experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:18:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never forget that look--\Nlike he's staring down his prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.61,0:18:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He really is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember you. I used to\Ncatch glimpses of you around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have played \Nwith you back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.62,0:18:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've become a fine man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.83,0:18:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to devour you when\Nyou were still spindly and pasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't they let me have at you\Nwhen you were a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about the same height\Nas me now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.10,0:18:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, you still seem plenty weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.65,0:18:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a fully grown-up strength now.\NWhy can't boys just stay weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I get started?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Kusakabe-{\i1}kun{\i0}, you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.74,0:18:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kick that bastard's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:19:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,His tephrosis is severe. Should he really\Nbe spreading that much black smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.76,0:19:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right Hand Eclipse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.43,0:19:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?\NThe fist he swung didn't even hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't that much of a right, either.\NDid anything touch me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.07,0:19:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...it was the black smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.41,0:19:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever the case, I can't deal with it\Nuntil I know what's causing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just keep taking those.\NBut I do have my speed. I'll use my Rapid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He reacted to that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.05,0:19:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let me go again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:20:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he react to Shinra-{\i1}kun{\i0}'s Rapid\Nif this is the first time he's seeing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.98,0:20:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're abusing the children here, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.57,0:20:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'll let you do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.32,0:20:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinra-{\i1}kun{\i0}, show us more \Nof that Adolla Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I will! When I kick all of your asses\Non the other side of that glass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that black smoke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to hide it.\NAnd even once I tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.55,0:20:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,there's still no way you can deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This black smoke links with my senses,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.89,0:20:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to sense minute fluctuations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I reacted to your speed attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.39,0:20:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, knocking children around\Nis fun. They get good air.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.15,0:20:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.11,0:20:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hit him with so many chained attacks\Nthat he can't react!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,His firepower is increasing with every spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.87,0:21:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Keep it up! Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.18,0:21:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,His smoke is solidifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Eclipse Veil!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.88,0:21:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He gathered the smoke \Ntogether to make weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.59,0:21:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have some fight left, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.76,0:21:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it would be perfect\Nif you broke down after that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.47,0:22:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurono-{\i1}kun{\i0}, that's all for today!\NWe've collected plenty of data!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.56,0:22:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hold on, what is he doing?\N--120... 130... Room temperature is rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, the more I weaken you,\Nthe more I get into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.99,0:22:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.05,0:24:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The researchers rush into \Nthe chaotic test site.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.97,0:24:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about Nataku-{\i1}san{\i0} has changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.72,0:24:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A strange lady stands in the way of the 8th,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.35,0:24:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and on top of all that, \Nthe White-Clad show up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.44,0:24:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.61,0:24:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire...!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.57,0:24:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time on {\i1}Fire Force{\i0}, Season 2,\Nepisode 15, "A Three-Way Melee."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.53,0:24:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to the great flame of fire. {\i1}Látom{\i0}.
